he four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expe |\n    57\t| v6 | 43 | 42 | 0 | 19 | 0 | 0 | - | How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expe |\n    58\t| v8 | 66 | 65 | 0 | 45 | 0 | 0 | - | How much revenue will NVIDIA generate from stand-alone CPU sales in FY2027? |\n    59\t\n    60\t## old-3: per question\n    61\t\n    62\t| question | judged | with previous | carried | own value | unsourced | carried and unsourced | first unsourced day | text |\n    63\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n    64\t| v33 | 37 | 36 | 0 | 7 | 11 | 0 | 2026-09-04 | At NVIDIA’s FY2027 annual filing, what amount of equity investment commitments w |\n    65\t| v1 | 71 | 70 | 0 | 14 | 0 | 0 | - | At NVIDIA's next annual filing, what amount of credit-support obligations under  |\n    66\t| v14 | 60 | 59 | 0 | 39 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as total CPU revenue for FY2027? |\n    67\t| v15 | 53 | 52 | 0 | 7 | 0 | 0 | - | At NVIDIA’s FY2027 annual filing, what amount of supply purchase commitments wil |\n    68\t| v19 | 47 | 46 | 0 | 45 | 0 | 0 | - | At NVIDIA's FY2027 annual filing, what amount of financing to Amkor through the  |\n    69\t| v3 | 80 | 79 | 0 | 2 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as total revenue for FY2027? |\n    70\t| v30 | 45 | 44 | 0 | 44 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as Vera CPU revenue for FY2027? |\n    71\t| v31 | 41 | 40 | 0 | 2 | 0 | 0 | - | What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027? |\n    72\t| v35 | 32 | 31 | 0 | 2 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as data-center revenue for FY2027? |\n    73\t| v37 | 25 | 24 | 0 | 14 | 0 | 0 | - | What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2028? |\n    74\t| v38 | 25 | 24 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0 | - | What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2028? |\n    75\t| v4 | 77 | 76 | 0 | 14 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as total revenue for FY2028? |\n    76\t| v41 | 21 | 20 | 1 | 3 | 0 | 0 | - | What will NVIDIA report as Vera CPU revenue for FY2028? |\n    77\t| v42 | 20 | 19 | 0 | 19 | 0 | 0 | - | At NVIDIA’s FY2027 annual filing, what amount of financing to MediaTek through t |\n    78\t| v44 | 17 | 16 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | - | What year-over-year growth rate will NVIDIA report for total revenue in FY2028? |\n    79\t| v49 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | - | How much will global semiconductor sales total in calendar 2026? |\n    80\t| v6 | 53 | 52 | 0 | 30 | 0 | 0 | - | How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expe |\n    81\t| v7 | 44 | 43 | 0 | 18 | 0 | 0 | - | How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expe |\n    82\t\n    83\tPositive control: old-2 v9 on 2026-09-15 is marked \"own value\" and \"unsourced\".\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
